00:02:03.119 --> 00:02:05.955
And in 2012,

00:02:05.997 --> 00:02:10.626
an Alabama judge sentenced someone to jail

00:02:10.668 --> 00:02:13.796
for wearing sagging pants.

00:02:13.838 --> 00:02:16.591
"You are in contempt of court,"
the judge said,

00:02:16.632 --> 00:02:19.427
"because you showed your butt in court."

